<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span><span id="A8.F10.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#B48C1E;">Generator</span><span id="A8.F10.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> prompt used for task synthesis in <span id="A8.F10.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Tool-R0</span>.</span> The system template enforces domain/context constraints, tool-menu cardinality, and primitive-only arguments, while requiring the final output to follow a strict four-block schema (<span id="A8.F10.10" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#404040;">&lt;think&gt;</span>, <span id="A8.F10.11" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#404040;">&lt;question&gt;</span>, <span id="A8.F10.12" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#404040;">&lt;available_tools&gt;</span>, <span id="A8.F10.13" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#404040;">&lt;tool_call_answer&gt;</span>).</figcaption>
</figure>
