<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>
<span id="A8.F11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Semantic alignment reward prompt template.</span>
Prompt used to compute the semantic alignment reward <math id="A8.F11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{\text{sem}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>sem</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{\text{sem}}</annotation></semantics></math> in <a href="#S3.E5" title='In Curriculum Reward (𝑟_"curr"): Difficulty &amp; Semantic Alignment. ‣ 3.2.1 Generator Reward Design ‣ 3.2 Generator Training ‣ 3 Method ‣ Tool-R0: Self-Evolving LLM Agents for Tool-Learning from Zero Data' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Equation</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, evaluating whether the synthesized user question is realistic and well-formed, and whether the corresponding tool call semantically and functionally satisfies the user’s request.
</figcaption>
</figure>
