<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>
<span id="A8.F12.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#28468C;">Solver</span><span id="A8.F12.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> prompt template.</span>
<span id="A8.F12.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">User_Query</span> indicates the user’s natural-language input,
while <span id="A8.F12.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">Tool_Menu</span> denotes the set of available tools;
both placeholders are instantiated dynamically at each training step.
</figcaption>
